context.md

# Proprietary vendor SDKs. install.sh asks for these by name and URL when they
# are missing; their licences do not permit this public repository to
# redistribute them, so nothing in here is ever committed.
#   - NI X Series DDK (nixseries.tar.gz) + its Linux OS interface
#   - Tucsen Dhyana camera SDK
libs/vendor/
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
*.egg
venv/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
